==Other Appearances==
==={{LCT|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
In {{LCT}}, Barrels appear as background objects in several stages. They can be shot at for a minor amount of points. In both the [[Link's Crossbow Training#Stage 2|Skull Shooting]] and [[Link's Crossbow Training#Stage 3|Fruit Balloons]] stages, one particular Barrel holds an [[Rupee|Orange Rupee]] worth 1000 points. Link must destroy the Barrel to reveal the Rupee. Barrels take three shots to destroy. Link receives one point for each hit and 5 for destroying it, for a total of 7 points per Barrel.
{{Noncanon|End}}

==={{CoH|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
{{Stub|CoH}}
Barrels are found as decorations inside certain [[House]]s.
{{Noncanon|End}}

